<ul style=3D"line-height:150%"></ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:22px">Hate making=
 returns? Hire someone to do it for you&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">After months of burning through your budget a=
nd stressing over finding the perfect presents, the season of giving is off=
icially over.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">But its remnants, like that horrendous sweate=
r your mom gave you (and which you pretended to love) and those purchases y=
ou thought twice about gifting, are still staring at you like an untouched =
chore list, just waiting to be returned.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Luckily for those of you who can=E2=80=99t be=
 bothered to do it yourself, there are professionals who will do it for you=
, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVw35P5ZqnLB=
W36QstJ3914rTW9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1nY2-ZW0W95jsWP6lZ3nxW6MNJhp3pQJ7kW3zWg8V3N7l=
gTW7KBTF04K1JdqN5C1ZCx5XP55VC1DSF4dpc9wW7Y7tL44_qBw6W8mTkdY5f0nJxW2vTsRc5H-=
KZYW5Lcjgb15VFM-W8NqvBJ5DfqwYW8Y6Fwz98ZX8vW6SG7h68z2q8YVMxN2s2VwLlsW6JQJPQ3=
XcPDHW4r9CkH9gbTqYW6Pz9R05fL9VTMp-w95j6xvDVZhfFm6gMPRNW5pvzMG5V_JX0W4kG4r28=
bsZzwTYLcf1dmDpBW4W003w4qXLTzW69S2vM4FVPqFVtDBF824pfNgVMw_qN942ZMMW4vZk_62B=
SKxHW7LlMh56XstQKN31Cb9hhTc5FW4twQvb4Xx6LZW6lGKk72w7Dr7f6ZMSWx04" style=3D"=
color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"5fred1rV" target=
=3D"_blank">per</a> <span style=3D"font-style: italic;">The Wall Street Jou=
rnal</span>.&nbsp;</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">ReturnQueen =E2=80=94 a six-year-old, first-of-its-kin=
d reverse logistics startup =E2=80=94 charges a ~$10 flat fee for pickups (=
up to 12 items per pickup) and takes care of packaging, labeling, and shipp=
ing. Customers simply leave returns on their doorstep, then a courier retri=
eves and delivers them to a ReturnQueen facility to be processed for shippi=
ng.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Ungrateful gift recipients are also tapping TaskRabbit=
, which reported a 62% YoY jump in return-related bookings across November =
and December, with most taskers charging ~$34 to run errands around this ti=
me.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">Larger companies like Uber and UPS offer <a href=3D"ht=
tps://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3914rTW9=
fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1mM2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3lFW6C4jcv4hfkQfW2_7DhB8Yw5jmVj-nn18lp7MLW=
2rrfsl7vwNBBN3WXrkBH-LXvW8ZkfyB5pV__yW3L0NFp1_4hW9Vs3JGD3l0d5HW4xHmM-82mp9s=
W7HWdGr1178zsW7tm_LY4HgvLHW6c1J2z2d-rhtW1sMpR9545KSlN29cJhTtxhMtVw84pJ7v_Gp=
RW2xsqqx4k8_jxVwCNyQ7hc_crW71ltKr135CSvW5BjCQB31SR0dW1MzTH98JMRXhVgHJS74YpP=
LqW3vW_9L4ljlZYf6whPhq04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" dat=
a-hs-link-id-v2=3D"aLLPeFy1" target=3D"_blank">similar</a> services, while =
smaller ones like College Hunks Hauling Junk &amp; Moving are looking to en=
ter the business to handle heavier return items following customer inquirie=
s.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">=E2=80=98Ti=
s the season of returns</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">An estimated 17% of holiday purchases will be=
 returned, and <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04=
/VVw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3914rTW9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1n22-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3mLW7Z9gPl65XW=
fcW6KvW27600XkBW9bsLtp4dPY4DW78tBT27QQr_DW83QCcp2VqfswW2J1vXm4fbk_hW1tlhzs5=
vP5TtW3X9wzK10Z5-CW1mgPnK6nPJTvN5XMW-gr_FWXN5p6GLW5Vm1lW2MPqqH5fCn0LW3xwqHQ=
5S36F0W7bbLJn61QLyjW7XrMZX17DJXxW57J5w67SDblLW7wk1V328H6z0W1sM8Hj427dF3W2xp=
G9270KJvYW13hvh96C5Bp3W4R59xp1005c_W4XPRLm8_xTMvVjgq5h2HM0bsW8GKjnq61PwsPf8=
xf0-j04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"P2y/MWXQ" target=3D"_blank">82%</a> of people will return a holiday gif=
t within a month of receiving it, per the National Retail Federation.&nbsp;=
</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Historically, January and February are the bi=
ggest months for returns, during which ReturnQueen expects to see a 15%-20%=
 increase in demand.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold">But returns=
 aren=E2=80=99t just a seasonal issue</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Americans are estimated to have returned ~$85=
0B worth of merchandise in 2025, and overall return rates have <a href=3D"h=
ttps://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3914rTW=
9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1mM2-ZW0W6N1vHY6lZ3mWW3kysNy15j1BgN639mbvfKZYHW4Bf1jL8dgtQR=
W1y-Gkn2dgVPKW88J1NK7nlGqPW240fxM1fj55RW5pnKHH8lZjK3V35fGy1lkTtlW6yHDVy7qPY=
5fW3wCzBW6Jn4_YW499F9k6v_GQ8VgfF5R1q6cRvW1dTw6t3hhtmcW4l8VkX81KkMPW178TcV8t=
sYtDW15spPK2lh6LwW3T8QY-8HzgR5W1hnqlf7Gh8lWW5vKnPT4_R7T6N1_j1zwFS1jtN1crF4p=
YsGqPW8V8j7T56wjCDf2F6kZP04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" =
data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"voXJzSsZ" target=3D"_blank">doubled</a> since 2019.&n=
bsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And while returns can be a nuisance for consu=
mers, for retailers, they can present huge operational costs. A 2023 <a hre=
f=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3=
914rTW9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1lT4ZwpbW50kH_H6lZ3lCW1wcqrF7CDKWfW1dhjVB5z6BP9W3LvBq=
Y1vkmP3W5cx5xW4n6mB3W3JMJnv18xMxlW807fhL73BhCsW1xvRry38bmx1MLhJxHk78xGVcqnK=
l3M3N5LW4XCqL86SM44gV5SV6S8nSM6hN7_kJRBykYTjN6S0dq-_yfXYVDVJZl1mRPwxW50qmKt=
92BVPsW6Xw9Mr4TWg0VW1zC_gD3H7mF8W4zztrq1DnZZ2V3kZbt9br3rGN67rG-wQQs6VVzXj61=
31jw9GV87B9p1WKFDHW1Lcrb58skRB7W3Ggtmb7CgXnhVz_zC23Gt3rjN5bGp25h4BwJW7f1BKF=
8H7gC-W7P9xG92zRZMHW51YfT98S0G_-VLfXws5-kyvdW15PSHN51STygW3dK02R7z5J9Bf4hhj=
9204" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"8=
yya6rVr" target=3D"_blank">report</a> found that processing a return can co=
st retailers 30% of the item=E2=80=99s original price, and many returns oft=
en end up in <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/V=
Vw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3914rTW9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1n22-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3krW5q0m701Dp5fr=
W4x8yn-4lJLF8Vrv79p8-5xT8W5DGZ969389TXW293ckX87lPvKW7dcNq85LdNWDVVn5r-8tzP_=
lW1xyZjg45nv3RW3gcFwn3Msl2mW6jzRtW7v_S8GW7dyRX_1BsSCFW6JZYjG5mDMvsW2VQCcD1q=
fNxQW35WCdd81515pW6f5rMD1pbJ-VW4LyCjl2Syw_LVTPGZX5xX9SrW4ZZf1l4C7DYWN99bNTl=
tzG9kW4htZqm7-VRcjW4QjBWC1PQxKvW6PSs-Y60pFdFW6944Bv1J-nzXW3Zkjcf8cxyMbf3DKc=
ZY04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"C=
Y4nJHw9" target=3D"_blank">landfills</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">To handle the growing number of returns, the =
NRF found that ~75% of retailers are now charging restocking fees =E2=80=94=
 some as high as <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf=
04/VVw35P5ZqnLBW36QstJ3914rTW9fbdmV5J4fctN5_C1nl2-ZW0W7Y8-PT6lZ3nRW2DhNlf9b=
VMWCW91gD-71YR8KbW6n49T86xDzdQW3X47Ps2bbFzQW6yCXyx667rLKW7jhqv93H7k0yW632CT=
N4Y02q4W7ZjRZ94d2lvCW2Xlp593CKzBCN4j6WwXWSsrqW11H8zK6wL6ppW1YdXjZ8m39bhW76f=
54g6DSlsgW5dlDNf3X3_r9W6gmkLD6QDcs9W2B_2KB25pjHPW9fnnQv8vzWmnW4NJnTx7YgCfGW=
8Fb4Js2HtpfQW1Xfjvv29J35HV7KXXK1VvKNjW6gb3Dy8m3Z71W1NrHXR4pYJpxW44QjkV4W3Pj=
FW2_Jxrv8G5bz6W295bRq291NJ4f3KLxx004" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-=
id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"Q84Cb785" target=3D"_blank">$45</a>.&nbsp;</=
p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Tack the cost of a return service onto those =
restocking fees, and it might just be worth it to keep pretending to love t=
hat sweater until you actually do.<br><br></p>
